      "signature": "FRenderAssetUpdate(In Asset)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "In Asset",
          "type": "UStreamableRenderAsset*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "This class provides a framework for loading and unloading the texture/mesh LODs.\nEach thread essentially calls Tick() until the job is done.\nThe object can be safely deleted when IsCompleted() returns true."
    },
    {
      "id": "tick",
      "name": "Tick",
      "category": "RenderAssetUpdate",
      "signature": "Tick(Target, In Current Thread)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "FRenderAssetUpdate*"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Current Thread",
          "type": "EThreadType"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Do or schedule any pending work for a given texture.\n@param InAsset - the texture/mesh being updated, this must be the same texture/mesh as the texture/mesh used to create this object.\n@param InCurrentThread - the thread from which the tick is being called. Using TT_None ensures that no work will be immediately performed."
    },
